{
  "display": {
    "icon": {
      "id": "minecraft:paper"
    },
    "title": {
      "translate": "I should riddle you a job",
      "extra": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    },
    "description": {
      "color": "light_purple",
      "translate": "The first is to trap wanderers, a "cinq" to be exact",
      "extra": [
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "as close as a chunk, make them work as a pact."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The second is to trade for every book at its max,,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "From the Librarian’s shelf, paying with no tax."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The third is to sign a résumé, not one but a ton,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "A hundred quills signed in your pack, and the work’s just begun."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The fourth is to craft from the cane by the river,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "A "job application" that you’re ready to deliver."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The fifth is to raid, let their attacks fall,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "From plains unto tundra, bring employment to role."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The sixth is a switch, their homes intertwine,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "the priest that takes gold, as does the swine."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The seventh is cruel, though its symbol is blessed,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "end the pig’s children, atleast seven at best."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The eighth is a trade to construe:"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "eight suns in a row, the hare’s banquet for you."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The ninth is a vagrant in a mansion of dread,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "let him live through nine sunsets, unclaimed, unfed."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "The tenth is a jest, you’ve surely lost class,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "to reach it at all means you'll need some grass."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "But conquer it whole, no reason to sob,"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "for you’ll earn in the end a true J.O.B."
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "And look in your inventory, don’t let it slip past!"
        },
        {
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "color": "light_purple",
          "translate": "you now hold The Forbidden Unemployment Tasks.nnSuggested by honestlytzadok"
        }
      ]
    },
    "frame": "challenge"
  },
